OL,3,AUS loses measles elimination status
OL,4,Aafter 26 years amid record case numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Jarbas Barbosa, director of PAHO,
OL,7,Fannounced that Mexico and Bolivia have
OL,8,Falso lost their measles elimination
OL,9,Fstatus, attributing the resurgence of
OL,10,Fmeasles in the region to persistent
OL,11,F"gaps in vaccination".
